                                                "sense_id": "4cb7d76f-7c33-389e-a9ed-c64497861837",
                                                "text": "Ten Straight White Males die of a mysterious disease and the nation has apoplexy — Headlines — TV Reports — Sympathy. MONEY comes pouring in and there was no discussion about where to find it."
